## Configuration & Deployment

### Environment Variables
```bash
# Database
POSTGRES_HOST=postgres
POSTGRES_DB=shatter
POSTGRES_USER=cnc_user
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<secure_password>

# Backend
BACKEND_PORT=8000
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
DEFAULT_POLL_INTERVAL=5  # seconds (can be overridden per machine)

# Frontend
REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Note: Machine configurations (IP, credentials, etc.) are stored
# in the database and managed via web UI, not in environment variables
```

### Quick Start (Target User Experience)
```bash
git clone https://github.com/user/shatter
cd shatter
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with database password (optional, has default)
docker-compose up -d
# Open http://localhost:3000
# Use web UI to add your CNC machines
```

