## API Design (Draft)

### REST Endpoints

**Machine Management:**
- `GET /api/machines` - List all configured machines
- `GET /api/machines/:id` - Get machine details
- `POST /api/machines` - Add new machine
- `PUT /api/machines/:id` - Update machine configuration
- `DELETE /api/machines/:id` - Remove machine
- `POST /api/machines/:id/test` - Test connection to machine
- `GET /api/machines/overview` - Overview status of all machines

**Machine Status (per machine):**
- `GET /api/machines/:id/status` - Current status, program, cycle time
- `GET /api/machines/:id/counters` - Workpiece counters
- `GET /api/machines/:id/alarms` - Current alarms
- `GET /api/machines/:id/tools` - Tool table
- `GET /api/machines/:id/position` - Current X/Y/Z position

**Historical Data:**
- `GET /api/history/runs?start=<iso8601>&end=<iso8601>&machines=1,2,3` - Production runs
- `GET /api/history/alarms?start=<iso8601>&end=<iso8601>&machines=1,2,3` - Alarm history
- `GET /api/history/stats?machines=1,2,3` - Summary statistics
- `GET /api/history/compare?machines=1,2,3&metric=cycle_time` - Cross-machine comparison

**File Management:**
- `GET /api/machines/:id/programs` - List NC programs on specific machine
- `GET /api/machines/:id/programs/:name` - Download program from machine
- `POST /api/machines/:id/programs` - Upload program to specific machine (multipart)
- `POST /api/programs/deploy` - Deploy program to multiple machines (multipart)
- `DELETE /api/machines/:id/programs/:name` - Delete program from machine
- `POST /api/programs/validate` - Validate program against machine(s)

**Version Control:**
- `GET /api/programs/:name/versions` - Version history
- `GET /api/programs/:name/versions/:id` - Specific version
- `GET /api/programs/:name/diff/:v1/:v2` - Diff between versions
- `POST /api/programs/:name/rollback/:version` - Rollback to version
- `GET /api/programs/:name/deployments` - See which machines have which versions

**WebSocket:**
- `WS /api/ws` - Real-time updates stream (all machines)

